# DS-0002: "Specify at least 1 USER command in Dockerfile with non-root user"
#
# autogole-api/packaging/Dockerfile runs as root on purpose. The base image
# starts supervisord as root (the deployment passes -u 0) and RTMon writes to
# /var/log/rtmon, /srv and /etc/grid-security at runtime, the last of which is
# refreshed by fetch-crl. Moving to a non-root user means reworking both the
# supervisord setup and volume ownership in the deployment, which is a change
# worth making on its own rather than as a side effect of an unrelated PR.
#
# The equivalent Checkov exception (CKV_DOCKER_3) is recorded inline in the
# Dockerfile.
DS-0002
